<title>NORWAY: TABLE-ELKEM H1 PROFITS BY DIVISION.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ELKEM H1 PROFITS BY DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operating reveunes and profits per</p>
<p>division at Norwegian metals producer Elkem ASA for</p>
<p>the six months to June 30.</p>
<p>				  (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Operating revenues</p>
<p>	   Ferrosilicon		973     vs     1,078</p>
<p>	   Manganese &amp; chrome    1,370     vs     1,395</p>
<p>	   Materials		 1,101     vs	 979</p>
<p>	   Aluminium		   778     vs	 804</p>
<p>	   Other			 484     vs	 482</p>
<p>Operating profit</p>
<p>	   Ferrosilicon		156     vs	 189</p>
<p>	   Manganese &amp; chrome	 80     vs	 193</p>
<p>	   Materials		   162     vs	 187</p>
<p>	   Aluminium		    71     vs	  80</p>
<p>	   Other			  75     vs	   3</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
